{"id":"00035e09fe6018d6","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal.md","title":"Syntactic Incompleteness","display":"df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal — Syntactic Incompleteness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal","aliases":["90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal"],"display":"df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal — Syntactic Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntactic-incompleteness]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal — Syntactic Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3edeb874814e8c15\" href=\"?note=3edeb874814e8c15\" title=\"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness\">90-df-syntactic-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>，用于同一编码下的否定码变换。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>理论及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T\\)</span> 必须使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 的同一呈示。句子编码的可判定性、解码及否定构造来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 与固定有效 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (effective signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (presented <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}\\)</span> (sentence-code predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total coded-negation function with default value, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> (external proof-code relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T\\)</span> (external theorem-code predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}\\)</span> (coded syntactic-incompleteness predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dFml}_{S,d}\">\\(\\operatorname{dFml}_{S,d}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a> 的公式解码分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\\)</span> 保证调用时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 在该分量的定义域中。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SyntInc}\">\\(\\mathrm{SyntInc}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3edeb874814e8c15\" href=\"?note=3edeb874814e8c15\" title=\"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness\">90-df-syntactic-incompleteness</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}formal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_S],\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng(\\neg\\operatorname{dFml}_{S,d}(n)),&amp;\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T(p,n),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(n)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}formal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_S],\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng(\\neg\\operatorname{dFml}_{S,d}(n)),&amp;\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n),\\\\\n0,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(n)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T(p,n),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(n)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{SyntInc}_S(T)\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{SyntInc}_S(T)\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"3edeb874814e8c15\" href=\"?note=3edeb874814e8c15\" title=\"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness\">90-df-syntactic-incompleteness</a> 的纯编码版本：量词只遍历自然数，良构句与否定都由编码函数检验。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T\\)</span> 是元语言中的自然数谓词；它通过外部关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T\\)</span> 定义，不能与对象语言公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)\\)</span> 混用。</li>\n<li>三个辅助谓词/函数的定义显式量化全部自然数码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 只服务于非法句子码，而不影响不完备性子句中已由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\\)</span> 保证合法的输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"