72de0","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论及 $\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T$ 必须使用 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一呈示。句子编码的可判定性、解码及否定构造来自 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 与固定有效 $g,d$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论及 $\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T$ 必须使用 [[90-df-proof-predicate]] 的同一呈示。句子编码的可判定性、解码及否定构造来自 [[90-df-syntax-interface]] 与固定有效 $g,d$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$ (external proof-code relation, see [[90-df-proof-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{dFml}_{S,d}$ 取 [[90-df-formula]] 的公式解码分量；$\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)$ 保证调用时 $n$ 在该分量的定义域中。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"3edeb874814e8c15","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SyntInc}$ 取 [[90-df-syntactic-incompleteness]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntactic-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"3edeb874814e8c15","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是 [[90-df-syntactic-incompleteness]] 的纯编码版本：量词只遍历自然数，良构句与否定都由编码函数检验。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofCode}_T","display":false},{"tex":"g,d","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dFml}_{S,d}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SyntInc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}syntactic\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}formal}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\n&\\leftrightarrow n\\in g[\\mathrm{Sent}_S],\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)\n&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\ng(\\neg\\operatorname{dFml}_{S,d}(n)),&\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n),\\\\\n0,&\\neg\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(n)\n&\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T(p,n),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(n)\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T(\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n))\n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{SyntIncCode}_{S,g}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{SyntInc}_S(T)\\bigr),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofCode}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SentCode}_{S,g}(n)","display":false}],"bytes":3431,"backlinks":[{"id":"c8a8e9086